# UX workflow: track structure redo restores the visible UI.
# Purpose: isolates the hardware regression where redo restored the sequencer
# track state musically but left the track strip/header on a stale UI preview.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen initial

# Switch structure navigation from pages to tracks.
150 tap NAV 60
350 capture screen track_navigation_focus

# Create Track 2 from the add-slot preview.
450 encoder NAV 1
650 capture screen track_2_add_preview
750 tap NAV 60
1050 capture screen track_2_created

# Undo Track 2 creation. The UI should return to Track 1 with no add-slot
# preview left armed.
1150 button LEFT_CENTER down
2150 tick
2200 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2380 capture screen undo_track_toast
2480 button LEFT_CENTER up
3900 capture screen track_2_creation_undone_ui

# Redo Track 2 creation. The UI must restore Track 2 as the focused/active
# track rather than leaving the old add-slot preview or Track 1 focus visible.
4000 button LEFT_CENTER down
5000 tick
5050 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
5230 capture screen redo_track_toast
5330 button LEFT_CENTER up
6750 capture screen track_2_creation_redone_ui
